=== A7 Nether fog probe ===
NETHER_FOG_DENSITY default = 70 -> densityScale = 0.70
borderFogDistance assumed    = 128 blocks (render distance)

--- Part 1: border-fog ramp, before vs after vs reference ---
  distance |  Astra bef  Astra aft |   frac bef   frac aft | reference (linear)
         8 |       2.2%       6.5% |      2.93x      2.93x | 8.3%  (limit 96)
        16 |       4.5%      12.6% |      2.82x      2.82x | 16.7%  (limit 96)
        32 |      10.1%      24.2% |      2.41x      2.41x | 33.3%  (limit 96)
        48 |      19.5%      35.9% |      1.84x      1.84x | 50.0%  (limit 96)
        64 |      35.7%      48.8% |      1.37x      1.37x | 66.7%  (limit 96)
        96 |      79.8%      77.0% |      0.97x      0.97x | 100.0%  (limit 96)
       128 |      99.0%      95.8% |      0.97x      0.97x | 100.0%  (limit 96)
       192 |     100.0%     100.0% |      1.00x      1.00x | 100.0%  (limit 96)

  fitted check: the after-ramp was solved so 16/32/64 blocks land on the
